647
00:47:33.660 --> 00:47:35.619
See tuli Harjumaale.

648
00:47:35.719 --> 00:47:37.880
Just nii, härra president.

649
00:47:37.980 --> 00:47:41.240
Ja Ann on osalenud laskepäevadel,
